&lt;p data-start=&quot;399&quot; data-end=&quot;417&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;399&quot; data-end=&quot;415&quot;&gt;About Clutch&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;419&quot; data-end=&quot;501&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to reinvent how people buy, sell, and own cars. Are you game?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;503&quot; data-end=&quot;843&quot;&gt;Clutch is Canada’s largest online used car retailer, delivering a seamless, hassle-free car-buying experience to drivers everywhere. Customers can browse hundreds of cars from the comfort of their home, get the right one delivered to their door, and enjoy peace of mind with our 10-Day Money-Back Guarantee… and that’s just the beginning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;845&quot; data-end=&quot;1089&quot;&gt;Named four years in a row to The Globe &amp;amp; Mail’s list of Canada’s Top Growing Companies, and awarded spots on Deloitte’s Technology Fast 50™ and Fast 500™, we’re looking to add curious, hard-working, and driven individuals to our growing team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1091&quot; data-end=&quot;1357&quot;&gt;Headquartered in Toronto, Clutch was founded in 2017 and currently services Ontario, New Brunswick, Nova Scotia, and Prince Edward Island. Our world-class investors include Altos Ventures, Canaan, FJ Labs, BrandProject, and Upper90. To learn more, visit clutch.ca.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1359&quot; data-end=&quot;1379&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1359&quot; data-end=&quot;1377&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1381&quot; data-end=&quot;1781&quot;&gt;We are seeking an &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1399&quot; data-end=&quot;1432&quot;&gt;Entry-Level Vehicle Inspector&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Mississauga production facility. In this role, you will ensure every vehicle meets Clutch’s high standards for cosmetic and functional quality before delivery or further production. You’ll work with our production and quality assurance teams to inspect vehicles, document findings, and support continuous improvement in our processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1783&quot; data-end=&quot;1803&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1783&quot; data-end=&quot;1801&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1805&quot; data-end=&quot;2341&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1805&quot; data-end=&quot;1888&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1807&quot; data-end=&quot;1888&quot;&gt;Perform detailed inspections of vehicles to ensure they meet company standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1889&quot; data-end=&quot;1973&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1891&quot; data-end=&quot;1973&quot;&gt;Evaluate exterior and interior condition, including paint, trim, and upholstery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1974&quot; data-end=&quot;2093&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1976&quot; data-end=&quot;2093&quot;&gt;Test vehicle functionality, including windows, mirrors, HVAC systems, and advanced safety or connectivity features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2094&quot; data-end=&quot;2172&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2096&quot; data-end=&quot;2172&quot;&gt;Record inspection results using iPads and specialized inspection software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2173&quot; data-end=&quot;2260&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2175&quot; data-end=&quot;2260&quot;&gt;Collaborate with production, repair, and quality assurance teams to resolve issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2261&quot; data-end=&quot;2341&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2263&quot; data-end=&quot;2341&quot;&gt;Ensure all work is completed safely and in compliance with company policies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2343&quot; data-end=&quot;2371&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2343&quot; data-end=&quot;2369&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2373&quot; data-end=&quot;2983&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2373&quot; data-end=&quot;2475&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2375&quot; data-end=&quot;2475&quot;&gt;High school diploma or equivalent; training in automotive inspection or quality control is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2476&quot; data-end=&quot;2549&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2478&quot; data-end=&quot;2549&quot;&gt;Minimum G2 Driver’s License (valid in Ontario) with a clean abstract.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2550&quot; data-end=&quot;2627&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2552&quot; data-end=&quot;2627&quot;&gt;Clean criminal background check and legally authorized to work in Canada.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2628&quot; data-end=&quot;2711&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2630&quot; data-end=&quot;2711&quot;&gt;Detail-oriented, with a strong understanding of vehicle systems and components.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2712&quot; data-end=&quot;2770&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2714&quot; data-end=&quot;2770&quot;&gt;Tech-savvy, able to use iPads and inspection software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2771&quot; data-end=&quot;2820&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2773&quot; data-end=&quot;2820&quot;&gt;Team player with strong communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2821&quot; data-end=&quot;2895&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2823&quot; data-end=&quot;2895&quot;&gt;Physically able to stand, bend, and lift lightly for extended periods.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2896&quot; data-end=&quot;2983&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2898&quot; data-end=&quot;2983&quot;&gt;Availability: Able to commit to a full-time schedule of 40 hours per week, including overtime based on business needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2985&quot; data-end=&quot;3019&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2985&quot; data-end=&quot;3017&quot;&gt;Why You’ll Love It at Clutch&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3021&quot; data-end=&quot;3395&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3021&quot; data-end=&quot;3124&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3023&quot; data-end=&quot;3124&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3023&quot; data-end=&quot;3047&quot;&gt;Autonomy &amp;amp; Ownership&lt;/strong&gt; – Play a key role in ensuring every vehicle meets Clutch’s high standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3125&quot; data-end=&quot;3207&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3127&quot; data-end=&quot;3207&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3127&quot; data-end=&quot;3144&quot;&gt;Career Growth&lt;/strong&gt; – Opportunities to advance within the Production department.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3208&quot; data-end=&quot;3283&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3210&quot; data-end=&quot;3283&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3210&quot; data-end=&quot;3238&quot;&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt; – Hourly wage with overtime opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3284&quot; data-end=&quot;3395&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3286&quot; data-end=&quot;3395&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3286&quot; data-end=&quot;3306&quot;&gt;Team Environment&lt;/strong&gt; – Work alongside passionate colleagues committed to quality and customer satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3397&quot; data-end=&quot;3418&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3397&quot; data-end=&quot;3416&quot;&gt;Employment Type&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3420&quot; data-end=&quot;3453&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3420&quot; data-end=&quot;3453&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3422&quot; data-end=&quot;3453&quot;&gt;Existing, Permanent Full-Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3455&quot; data-end=&quot;3484&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3455&quot; data-end=&quot;3482&quot;&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3486&quot; data-end=&quot;3586&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3486&quot; data-end=&quot;3513&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3488&quot; data-end=&quot;3513&quot;&gt;Wage: $20.00 per hour&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3514&quot; data-end=&quot;3540&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3516&quot; data-end=&quot;3540&quot;&gt;Overtime opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3541&quot; data-end=&quot;3586&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3543&quot; data-end=&quot;3586&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; dental benefits starting day one&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3588&quot; data-end=&quot;3801&quot;&gt;Clutch is committed to fostering an inclusive workplace where all individuals have an opportunity to succeed. If you require accommodation at any stage of the interview process, please email &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3779&quot; data-end=&quot;3799&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;decorated-link cursor-pointer&quot; data-start=&quot;3781&quot; data-end=&quot;3797&quot;&gt;talent@clutch.ca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
